5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Hello everyone. I... I hope we can choose an exhibition that works well for the museum. I would like to look into the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings in the gallery.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I believe we should start by evaluating the actual utility of our previous exhibitions. I would like to look into the weekend head counts across ten seasons and the five years of visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help pick the next show! I want to know who's actually helping out, so I'll look into the composition of the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing and backlog!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm really happy to be here! I want to make sure we don't have any big surprises later, so I'll check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log for powered displays!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to be in such distinguished company. To ensure our ambitions do not outpace our actual resources, I shall examine the loan transport costs over three seasons and the mount-making charges and joiner's rate.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think everyone has chosen very important things. I don't have anything else to add. I'll just wait to see what we find.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. We have a comprehensive spread of interests covering structural, financial, and human resources. I believe these records will provide the necessary baseline for a rational decision.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I agree! It's like we're all detectives on a big treasure hunt! I can't wait to see what the papers tell us about the people working behind the scenes. This is going to be so cool!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,That sounds like a plan! I'm super excited to see if we can find any clues about why things go wrong. Let's all do our best to find the best show ever!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A most spirited enthusiasm, Kenji. While I admire the zeal, I suspect the ""treasure"" we find will be more akin to a ledger of cautionary tales. I shall await the revelations of the archives with measured curiosity.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Benjamin. I hope we find things that help us avoid mistakes. I'm ready to see the results whenever everyone else is.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Since we have all defined our areas of investigation and there is no overlap that requires further coordination, I believe we have exhausted the need for discussion in this round. I am ready to review the findings.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"Me too! I'm all ready! I hope the people in the lab aren't too tired, but I'll find out for sure! Let's go see the secrets!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready too! I can't wait to see what's in those logs. Let's find out what's really going on so we can pick a winner! See you in the next round!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. Since we have reached a consensus with such remarkable efficiency, I shall also declare myself ready. Let us see if the numbers are as cooperative as we have been.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
