34,2,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I found that the suspended bay has a weight limit of four hundred kilos per square metre. Also, evening hires mean caterers and chairs move through the gallery, and some open displays have been damaged.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"My findings suggest a clear pattern in visitor behavior. Head counts increase significantly for exhibitions with active mechanisms or changing displays, while static, cased objects fail to encourage repeat visits.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Oh no! I found out the conservation lab is almost empty! There's only one person working there, and they have a huge pile of two hundred things waiting to be cleaned! That's way too much work for one person!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wow, that's a lot of problems! I found out that some shows started late because paperwork from other museums didn't arrive in time for the shipping deadlines. Also, powered displays broke down seventeen times last season!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It appears we are uncovering a symphony of systemic frictions. My review suggests that loan transport and insurance are quietly consuming a third of our installation budget, while the cost of bespoke mount-making is climbing steeply.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm worried. If we pick something too heavy or too fragile, it might be a problem. The floor can't take everything, and the evening events make the space... a bit chaotic.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, your concerns are valid, but we must not let fear of damage dictate our choice. My data shows that static displays, while safer, are precisely what fail to bring visitors back to the museum.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, but if we pick something fancy and active, who is going to fix it if it breaks? With only one person in the lab, they'll be way too tired to help! We need to be careful!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, you're totally right! And it's not just the lab—those powered displays are already breaking all the time! If we pick something with lots of moving parts, we might just end up roping off half the gallery again!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, a most pertinent observation. It would be a charming irony to curate a spectacle of innovation only to have it spend its tenure as a collection of ""Out of Order"" signs. We are painting ourselves into a corner of operational fragility.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't want anyone to be stressed. If the lab is empty and the displays keep breaking, it sounds like a lot of pressure. Maybe we should look for something... simpler? Something that doesn't risk the floor or the staff.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, simplicity is a safe harbor, but it is often a sterile one. The records show that visitors crave engagement. We must find a balance where the exhibition is active enough to attract people, yet manageable for our staff.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, but ""balance"" is hard when the people are missing! If we pick something that needs a lot of cleaning or fixing, that one person in the lab will be super sad and overwhelmed. We have to pick something they can actually handle!","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, exactly! And we can't forget the shipping! If we pick a show with tons of loans from far away, we might not even open on time. We need a project that's actually possible to deliver without a huge headache!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, your concern for the logistics is most prudent. When one combines the risk of shipping delays with the escalating costs of transport and bespoke mounts, a ""grand"" exhibition can quickly become a financial black hole. We must avoid a proposal that treats our budget as an infinite resource.","{""words"":49,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree. It feels like we are all seeing different risks, but they all lead to the same place. I just hope we can find a candidate that doesn't push the building or the people too far.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
51,2,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
52,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"We are all identifying different friction points, but the core issue is the same: the gap between ambition and reality. We must prioritize a candidate that offers engagement without operational collapse.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
53,2,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
54,2,4,talk,Rin,,I agree! We can't just think about the visitors; we have to think about the people who actually do the work! Let's find a show that's fun but doesn't make the staff cry from too much work!,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
55,2,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
56,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with you, Rin! Let's look for a show that's exciting for the visitors but doesn't rely on too many far-away loans or breakable machines. We need a winner that actually opens on time!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
57,2,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
58,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a rare pleasure to see such a cohesive alignment of caution. We seek a candidate that is visually stimulating yet fiscally disciplined, avoiding the siren song of expensive bespoke mounts and logistical nightmares. I am ready to see the proposals.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
59,2,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
